Cell["\<\
Form equivalent is reciprocal MV. Computation of value is just inner product \
with corresponding primary vectors. Seems that we have to reverse order of \
vectors on which form is computed in order to match book\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
sign. \
\>", "Text",
